title: 'Snowbridge: V1 inbound queue fee-fronting liveness tests'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Adds tests for Snowbridge V1 inbound queue fee fronting: a message is rejected without state
    changes when neither the relayer nor the Asset Hub sovereign can cover the fee, and a failed
    below-existential-deposit reimbursement does not stall the channel. Tests only, no functional
    changes.
crates:
- name: snowbridge-pallet-inbound-queue
  bump: none
